qfappd (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix block enforcement: NF_ACCEPT verdicts reinject at the next forward
    hook, skipping the rest of the queueing base chain, so the persist and
    block rules placed there never ran — verdicts were computed and logged
    but nothing was ever dropped. They now live in a second forward base
    chain (`forward_verdict`, priority filter + 20) that reinjected packets
    do traverse.

 -- QuartzFire <cwellman@quartz.systems>  Sat, 11 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000

qfappd (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: nDPI-based Application Control for QuartzFire.
    - Named actions with per-application / per-category allow-block verdicts.
    - Per-firewall-rule bindings via ct-mark ACTION_ID.
    - NFQUEUE classification with conntrack-mark fast-path offload.
    - gRPC introspection API + JSON event stream.

 -- QuartzFire <cwellman@quartz.systems>  Sat, 11 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
